### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@alertId = 1

### Get all alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts

### Count unresolved alerts for the home page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/unresolved-count

### Filter active high-severity alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=ACTIVE&severity=HIGH

### Filter by hierarchy
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?organizationId=1&labId=1&roomId=1&sensorId=1

### Get one alert
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}

### Acknowledge alert
# Requires an authenticated session and CSRF token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge

### Resolve alert
# Requires an authenticated session and CSRF token.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outcome": "FIXED",
  "comment": "Cooling restored; temperature returned to the safe range."
}

### Reopen a resolved alert after an incorrect resolution
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/reopen
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The cooling system is still offline; the issue was not actually resolved."
}
